{"verse_key": "10:47", "surah": 10, "verse": 47, "text_uthmani": "وَلِكُلِّ أُمَّةٍ رَّسُولٌ ۖ فَإِذَا جَآءَ رَسُولُهُمْ قُضِىَ بَيْنَهُم بِٱلْقِسْطِ وَهُمْ لَا يُظْلَمُونَ", "translation": "And for every nation is a messenger. So when their messenger comes,<sup foot_note=196446>1</sup> it will be judged between them in justice, and they will not be wronged.", "verse_from_ms": 1122720, "verse_to_ms": 1138650, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَلِكُلِّ", "start_ms": 1122720, "end_ms": 1124110}, {"i": 1, "text": "أُمَّةٍ", "start_ms": 1124110, "end_ms": 1125380}, {"i": 2, "text": "رَّسُولٌ", "start_ms": 1125380, "end_ms": 1127120}, {"i": 3, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1127120, "end_ms": 1127970}, {"i": 4, "text": "فَإِذَا", "start_ms": 1127970, "end_ms": 1129850}, {"i": 5, "text": "جَآءَ", "start_ms": 1129850, "end_ms": 1131100}, {"i": 6, "text": "رَسُولُهُمْ", "start_ms": 1131100, "end_ms": 1131650}, {"i": 7, "text": "قُضِىَ", "start_ms": 1131650, "end_ms": 1133330}, {"i": 8, "text": "بَيْنَهُم", "start_ms": 1133330, "end_ms": 1134260}, {"i": 9, "text": "بِٱلْقِسْطِ", "start_ms": 1134260, "end_ms": 1134940}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَهُمْ", "start_ms": 1134940, "end_ms": 1135280}, {"i": 11, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 1135280, "end_ms": 1138215}, {"i": 12, "text": "يُظْلَمُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}